WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit tall on a chair or bolster.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Interlace hands behind or hold the chair back.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lift the chest and soften the shoulders.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the collarbones.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release slowly.
